        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-slide" data-carousel-target="slide">
        <img src="image3.jpg" alt="Slide 3">
        <div class="carousel-content">
          <h2>READY FOR ANY CHALLENGE</h2>
          <button class="carousel-button">OUR SERVICES</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  <button class="carousel-prev" data-action="carousel#prev">❮</button>
  <button class="carousel-next" data-action="carousel#next">❯</button>
  </div>
  <div class="container-call">
    <div><p>CALL AND TALK TO OUR SERVICE ADVISOR</p>
    </div>

    <div class="button">CLICK TO CALL</div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h1>TRUCKS OF NEVADA SEMI TRUCK REPAIR SHOP</h1>
    <p>Bring your heavy duty commercial truck to our repair shop in Las Vegas.<br>We provide the best maintenance and repairs.</p>

    <div class="cards">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="hex-icon">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i></div>
            <h2>GREAT TEAM</h2>
            <p>Expect great customer service from the first phone call, to your first visit and all the subsequent visits.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="hex-icon">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i></div>
            <h2>WIDE RANGE OF SERVICES</h2>
            <p>Diagnostic, Oil Change or Engine Repairs... We can handle it all in our repair shop.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="hex-icon">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast"></i></div>
            <h2>ROADSIDE ASSISTANCE</h2>
            <p>Major breakdown around Las Vegas? Call us 24/7 and our Mobile Semi Truck Assistance will be on their way to you.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
  </section>
